        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chromium browsers support the Crash Reporting API in version 145<br>\nSpec: <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/crash-reporting/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/crash-reporting/</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/6228675846209536\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/6228675846209536</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/UD2RcDSb270/m/lqU-bKuMAAAJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/UD2RcDSb270/m/lqU-bKuMAAAJ</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None, I think.</p>",
