        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Safari 26.0 supports axis relative keywords for CSS properties that accept <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;position&gt;</code><br>\nFirefox and Chromium have no support.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">WebKit bug: <a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=292069\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=292069</a><br>\nChromium bug: <a href=\"https://crbug.com/432676117\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://crbug.com/432676117</a><br>\nFirefox bug: Couldn't find one.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None, I think.</p>",
